        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Create Spells and Battle in an AI × Kanji Duel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges you to create original four-kanji spells using randomly distributed kanji characters.<br>The AI will analyze and describe the damage, element, and effect of your spell.<br>The thrill lies in how creatively you can combine the given kanji to craft a spell that feels powerful—your word sense is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Sometimes, Weakness is Strength</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you won’t always win by making the strongest-looking spell.<br>There are moments when crafting a deliberately weak spell is part of the strategy.<br>Your tactical flexibility will be tested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Battle with friends and families</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A local versus mode where two players compete for kanji characters to create their own original spells and fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players can play together on a single PC, and since it also supports <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>, you can enjoy online battles with friends from afar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Chuunibyou-Style Spell Descriptions, Too...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, the AI might even describe your spell in dramatic, over-the-top style—straight out of a teenage fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses the conversational AI &quot;ChatGPT&quot; provided by OpenAI. Depending on server load, the game may take extra time to process spell evaluations.<br><br>If OpenAI makes any changes to the ChatGPT service, this game may be suspended or discontinued without prior notice. We appreciate your understanding.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Create Spells and Battle in an AI × Kanji Duel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges you to create original four-kanji spells using randomly distributed kanji characters.<br>The AI will analyze and describe the damage, element, and effect of your spell.<br>The thrill lies in how creatively you can combine the given kanji to craft a spell that feels powerful—your word sense is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Sometimes, Weakness is Strength</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you won’t always win by making the strongest-looking spell.<br>There are moments when crafting a deliberately weak spell is part of the strategy.<br>Your tactical flexibility will be tested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Battle with friends and families</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A local versus mode where two players compete for kanji characters to create their own original spells and fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players can play together on a single PC, and since it also supports <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>, you can enjoy online battles with friends from afar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Chuunibyou-Style Spell Descriptions, Too...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, the AI might even describe your spell in dramatic, over-the-top style—straight out of a teenage fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses the conversational AI &quot;ChatGPT&quot; provided by OpenAI. Depending on server load, the game may take extra time to process spell evaluations.<br><br>If OpenAI makes any changes to the ChatGPT service, this game may be suspended or discontinued without prior notice. We appreciate your understanding.</p>",
        "short_description": "AI Spellcraft is a battle game where you create original spells using kanji, and an AI evaluates their damage and effects. Use your word sense to craft the ultimate spell!",
        "supported_languages": "Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
